{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after end-hook dispatch.** The only check occurs before `onInvocationEnd`. If a blocking end hook lets the handler owner report `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, `execute()` can still return PENDING/RETRYING despite observing the fatal before the Lambda response. Recheck `scopeFatal` after dispatch without invoking hooks again, and update the late-dispatch regression to expect the original fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77DAT8","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":464,"observation_digest":"89bc205ee01aabd11ae2e531183728ce57b29b0e25f2f2916b47f10253321762","observation_id":"aro_v1_rg6caxxadkv5cgxc4uyrqnzizz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T20:53:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tujjnijtxmpx5jkyok2a45jisj","reviewed_base_sha":"95a63f3a9db5d327620d76fb95b8372f53db6eaa","reviewed_head_sha":"0632f62b83633e4d11afa3611865022d7e771997","reviewer":"codex","start_line":464,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_kcjsumw2jt4lovzkjcecmww6yt"},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_aqjpbacsxctpw7thsrgkg2a7ov","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T20:53:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
